    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just hard to see it that way when the reality is so much more practical. love doesnt pay the rent or buy groceries. i look at them sleeping and i just think... if they had my portion of the money, their lives would actually get easier. it feels less like a crisis and more like just seeing the truth of the situation. like, if a math equation is broken, wouldn't you just solve it?",
